cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OBSERVE or the 012-ternary research, please cite it as below."
title: "OBSERVE / 012-ternary: local semantic code search and ternary-computing research"
abstract: >-
  A research and tooling project on ternary computing ({-1, 0, +1}), from
  SystemVerilog RTL through a balanced-ternary CPU emulator to OBSERVE, a local,
  private semantic code-search tool (desktop app, CLI, and MCP server). Includes
  measured positive and negative results and a six-study scoping-rule ladder.
type: software
authors:
